>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>58-62.5 kg / 128-138 lbs</td>\n<td>160-170 cm / 63-67 in</td>\n<td>94 cm / 37.0 in</td>\n<td>90 cm / 35.4 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>100 cm / 39.4 in</td>\n<td>92 cm / 36.2 in</td>\n<td>90 cm / 35.4 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother L</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>63-69.5 kg / 139-153 lbs</td>\n<td>165-175 cm / 65-69 in</td>\n<td>98 cm / 38.6 in</td>\n<td>91 cm / 35.8 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>104 cm / 40.9 in</td>\n<td>96 cm / 37.8 in</td>\n<td>91 cm / 35.8 in</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>The Ivory Bow Back Mommy and Me Dresses bring an easy, photo-ready feel to matching summer style. The breathable cotton fabric keeps the dress light and comfortable, while the tonal embroidered texture adds depth without taking away from the soft ivory palette.</p>\n\n<p>From beach mornings to birthday brunches, the scalloped trim and oversized back bow give this matching dress set a polished finish that still feels playful. It is an easy mother-daughter silhouette for portraits, vacations, and every warm-weather plan in between.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Breathable cotton feel:</strong> Soft woven cotton keeps the silhouette cool and summer friendly.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Oversized bow-back detail:</strong> A dramatic back bow adds a standout finish for mom and mini.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Scalloped trim:</strong> Delicate scalloped edging frames the sleeveless armholes with a sweet polished touch.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Tonal embroidered texture:</strong> Subtle woven embroidery adds dimension while keeping the ivory palette refined.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Mom and mini matching:</strong> Coordinated mother-and-daughter styling makes family dressing feel effortless.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose your sizes and bring home an ivory matching dress set that feels ready for every warm-weather memory.</p>","tags":["Beach","Bow Back","Butterfly Bow","Child 1-2yr","Child 2-3yr","Child 4-5yr","Child 6-8yr","Child 9-10yr","Cotton","Dresses"